        "title": "Giving ‘IT’ Another Shot",
        "description": "<p>So, yeah … whoever knows me knows how many shots I’ve given to consistent writing </p><p>Had a blogspot <br>Used twitter <br> Maybe even a podcast I never saw through… <br>Used a writing app<br> Even tried a novel once (doubt anyone knew this, my secret…)<br>I only ever did one chapter, that’s if I finished it…</p><p>So, yeah, giving ‘IT’ another shot … or is it them?</p><p>Them, ‘cos healthy living was another thing I said I was gon’ be giving a shot last year<br>I tried, trust me, I did <br>Subscribed to a gym twice…2 months<br>…safe to say there was just a day in each month</p><p>So, again ‘yeah’, wanna see if I’ll be able to be a lil more consistent in both, by carrying my lil circle along <br>…my circle is gon’ be whoever chooses to read these posts sometimes…</p><p>So, I’mma be posting on my gym stories… giving almost daily updates, and then every other thing</p><p>I’ve never been a fan of writing about my personal life<br>Neither am I so much of a fictional writing <br>Prior to now, I’ve always kinda blended both, 1% non-fiction, 99% fiction <br>I tagged it ‘non-fiction fictional writing’</p><p>…now, I think we’ll be doing more nonfiction <br>Won’t allocate percentage yet, let’s ride together</p><p>…the corporate world would influence me saying ‘regards’, but I did say y’all are my lil circle, so, I choose</p> <p>Peace, lovers 🤗🤗</p>",
