        "title": "Free Joy, NOT Cheap Joy",
        "description": "<p>So... all that info is in previous post is so that I get the platform to drop something again (sense 😉🙂).</p><p>My loves, JOY is free and available to all BUT it sure AIN'T CHEAP.</p><p>So, my convalescent self was on my way to the hospital for the last batch of my injections (my butts is sure on fire from previous ones, but what can a baby girl do 🙁☹️</p><p>Anyway...</p> <p>This driver, looking all tired, rough and all (a Lagos hustler driver ofcourse. GOD PLEASE HELP US ALL WITH NO SILVER SPOON)<br>Halfway into the drive (less than 10minutes drive anyway), after his bus was hit by a police officer for 'illegal parking'and a threat to deflate his tires (again, this' Lagos, and the heart of it ofcos...)</p><p>...back on track...</p><p>Young man baby boy did put more volume to his music (not new, I know, we're all used to noise in this Lagos, sadly...)</p><p>...anyway...</p><p>...as I was saying... bro started to groove to the music, hands off the wheels, on a BRT express lane 😳😲 (Apologies to those who don't know what BRT is 🌚...)</p><p>Trust me, I sure wanted to caution him cos I was on the front passenger's seat yeah? But bro, I couldn't bring me to do it. I just smiled and realized all over again; JOY IS FREE BRO, JOY IS FREE SIS.</p><p>Man has sure had a long day, will still have a long day despite that it was evening then (it doesn't get dark in this part of Nigeria you know? 😉</p><p>Long story short, I started dancing a lil on that seat myself, smiling 🤣🤣</p><p>Summary is...in it all, the struggles and hustles, find your joy and let nothing ever take it away from you...</p><p>PS: THE BEST FORM OF JOY IS FOUND IN JESUS CHRIST you know? Well, now you do 😊</p><p>And yes, we're still here... I AM!!! 🤷🏻‍♀️</p><p>But don't drive HANDS FREE, except it's a tech/robot car or whatever 😊</p><p>Love love,<br>#EYILZ!!! 😚🥰🥰🥰🥰</p>",
